 serviços.\n\nUm imóvel com personalidade, arquitetura, sofisticação e conforto em cada detalhe, pronto para proporcionar uma experiência diferenciada de morar.\nAgende sua visita com a MARAGNA Imóveis Selecionados.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/263ae721-c334-4c8a-bce6-ef681b6ebfac.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d1659822-aa5d-4f02-a797-cd5a7bc966de.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/64dbcf7d-1494-425c-be28-5aa3e16c7562.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/11e037b6-5664-4831-b015-3461c7999492.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b8d0421f-bc11-43ff-9909-6b8769ce2497.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f29f388a-7b12-43d7-9e29-ba6dc3d5f73a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3ccf37fa-261b-4893-bdbb-318d49f6d1f9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ee91050e-c8ff-4dd8-92d2-41c72273fc11.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/96db571d-356e-4773-a9a1-8227ac9d7bb8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/dfb3830a-f856-4c42-8ae7-38f46049edac.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/eb3feebd-3130-47d8-af4b-8716ceb4b4b7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6afca8a4020778a22108c806/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8d76d74e-7782-4a82-87a8-b74c5